B.a6n=new A.cc("Although the use of AI in the tech & software development industry is commonplace, I still want to be transparent about the extent of AI used when building this web app. \n\nI designed, created, built, and deployed this web app myself. However, AI (Claude) was used to replace repetitive work such as typing up the code (templates, repetitive code), and for debugging.\n\nNo AI was used for generating images or designs. I drew the icons myself or they are pulled form the Google open-source library that is built into the Flutter framework. The map was created in Figma by myself based off of the expo map. \n\nAnd the database used for storing user information is Firestore/Firebase, which is a Google product.",null,null,B.P,null,null,null,null,null,null,B.a9C)
